        <updated>2026-10-04T17:27:26-04:00</updated>
            <summary type="html">
                <![CDATA[
                        <img src="https://words.skylarkfoundry.com/media/posts/26/images-4.jpeg" alt="" />
                    We bury today our Alleluia. It is not dead, but on deposit,&hellip;
                ]]>
            </summary>
        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://words.skylarkfoundry.com/media/posts/26/images-4.jpeg" class="type:primaryImage" alt="" /></p>
                <p class="align-center">We bury today our Alleluia.<br>It is not dead,<br>but on deposit,<br>as our brother<br>who sleeps.</p>
<p class="align-center">But we who amble on,<br>don this burlap<br>and turn our<br>face to ash,<br>in penance.</p>
<p class="align-center"><br>This Lent more somber<br>as bombs fall,<br>as children flee,<br>while we wait<br>His return.</p>
            ]]>
        </content>
