    <entry>
        <title>Liquor</title>
        <author>
            <name>Kevin Kwilinski</name>
        </author>
        <link href="https://words.skylarkfoundry.com/liquor.html"/>
        <id>https://words.skylarkfoundry.com/liquor.html</id>
        <media:content url="https://words.skylarkfoundry.com/media/posts/20/sippytitle-1.jpg" medium="image" />

        <updated>2026-09-28T20:47:10-04:00</updated>
            <summary type="html">
                <![CDATA[
                        <img src="https://words.skylarkfoundry.com/media/posts/20/sippytitle-1.jpg" alt="" />
                    The poetic word is potent. Like one hundred and seven proof bourbon,&hellip;
                ]]>
            </summary>
        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://words.skylarkfoundry.com/media/posts/20/sippytitle-1.jpg" class="type:primaryImage" alt="" /></p>
                <div class="align-center">The poetic word is potent.<br>Like one hundred and seven proof<br>bourbon,<br>it makes me drunk.</div>
<div class="align-center"><br>Plenty of pages of prose<br>are distilled in<br>a single<br>verse.</div>
<div class="align-center"><br>It is irresistible as<br>I swirl it in my mouth.<br>Sniff it.<br>Taste it.</div>
<div class="align-center"><br>I breathe it in.</div>
<div class="align-center"><br>I hold it up to the light<br>to peer into its soul.</div>
<div class="align-center"><br>With voracious appetite,<br>I invert its glass until</div>
<div class="align-center"><br>the</div>
<div class="align-center"><br>last</div>
<div class="align-center"><br>drip</div>
<div class="align-center"><br>slides</div>
<div class="align-center">so<br>slowly</div>
<div class="align-center"><br>onto my </div>
<div class="align-center">silver<br>tongue.</div>
            ]]>
        </content>
    </entry>
